OL,3,GNEWSADemolition work at pier landing
OL,4,Astage completed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to demolish a pier's landing stage
OL,7,Fhas been completed and the pierhead has
OL,8,Freopened to the public, Jersey Ports
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FOriginally it had been hoped the work
OL,12,Fto remove Gorey Pier's deteriorating
OL,13,Fstructure would be completed before the
OL,14,Fsummer.
OL,16,FPorts of Jersey said it also resurfaced
OL,17,Fthe pedestrian walkway and the newly
OL,18,Finstalled railings would be painted to
OL,19,Fenhance both the area's appearance and
OL,20,Foverall safety.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
