OL,3,GNEWSADemolition work at pier landing
OL,4,Astage completed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCaptain William Sadler, Jersey harbour
OL,7,Fmaster, said it was "an important
OL,8,Fmilestone in our ongoing commitment to
OL,9,Fprotecting and preserving Gorey Pier,
OL,10,Fit was essential for safety but also
OL,11,Fsafeguards the historic granite pier
OL,12,Ffor the community to enjoy for years to
OL,13,Fcome".
